  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RtF &#x2013; Ethiopia ORDA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ORDA Ethiopia will set up and implement a Reversing the Flow (RtF) project in Koti Kebele, Yilmana Desna Woreda, Amhara Region, Ethiopia. ORDA targets 6 watersheds in this kebele.As RtF hub, ORDA takes a facilitative role. They will support watershed users&apos; cooperatives for collective landscape development.At the same time, ORDA will support household level interventions through Village Economic and Social Associations (VESAs).</narrative>
  </description>
